<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cullinan sells its electrical division.</title>
<headline>Cullinan sells its electrical division.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cullinan Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had sold its Electrical Division with effect from November 1.  </p>
<p>It said the sale would be payable in cash and was based on the net asset value of the division on the effective date. It said the net asset value was still subject to an audit which was expected to be completed by Friday.</p>
<p>Cullinan said once the audit had been completed, a further announcement would be made setting out details regarding the disposal.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
